    },
    {
        "text": "Friston does not understand why his daughter chose this as their meeting place."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fssand"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no vacation spot. Too much sand in one's shoes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should take a break.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "He sits on a dune and removes his shoes, only for the wind to send the sand he pours out into his face."
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is most undignified\u2014why am I in full dress?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did she ask me to come here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fssand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no answer on the radio. He wanders aimlessly on the yellow sands, calling his daughter's name."
    },
    {
        "text": "No one answers until night has fallen."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bar_intro",
        "key": "$bar_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_desert03_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 4
    },
    {
        "text": "...A party?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "He follows the sound to find the camp on the dunes in the distance, filled with lights and ribbons."
    },
    {
        "text": "He hears his daughter's familiar laughter, and runs towards her in joy."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowrun",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You made it to my wedding, dad!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Daughter'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friston almost cries at the sight of the golden hair."
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been looking for you for so long, my sunshine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this your wedding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. The ceremony is about to start. Let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Daughter'"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll walk the red carpet, arm in arm. Give me your blessings, dad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Daughter'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friston tries to take her arm, but he can not reach it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you not give me your blessing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Daughter'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No... no, that\u2019s not what I meant... I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
