        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_energybody"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown Language) I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you not give me your blessing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disjointed Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown Language) ...Sunshine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You did not want us to see the truth of the stars?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) ...You're not my sunshine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Have I left home? I remember this bunker\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) 'The preservation room'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will not answer any more of my questions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Kristen. You're Kristen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) I've heard of you. No, I've seen you... no. How did I know you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) I've never known you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Who the devil turned off the light?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Trevor Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Damn it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why have you imprisoned me here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston"
    },
    {
        "text": "Closure! Is this another one of your damned jokes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rhodesbedroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro",
        "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Friston realizes that he is buried in the 'photos' that fill the room. A volume of 'A Complete Bestiary of Terra' covers his camera module."
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they even photos? He has never visited the places in them, nor could he ever."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are only fragmented images on the countless photos."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sand dune, bonfire, camp, golden hair, and the preservation room where the sun does not shine."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A dream...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friston dreamed. Friston-3 dreamed."
    },
    {
        "text": "He printed his own dream."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It should not be possible for me to dream. Did Closure upload a new firmware without telling me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rhodesengineeringroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1723_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have time to argue with you right now, Mr. Friston!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guarantee you in the strongest possible terms that I have not uploaded any firmware that could have caused you to dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "The PRTS anomalies are getting out of control. It will take time to deploy the backup command system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the work has to be assigned manually. I wish I had six or seven pairs of eyes! We've completely lost contact with some areas and we have no idea what's going on\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, Closure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not trying to argue with you. I just want to make sure that all possibilities for my unusual malfunctions are accounted for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've eliminated firmware bugs and hardware malfunctions as possibilities. Then\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1723_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Answer me, Closure... this is important...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is the energy source that powers my core?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1723_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Originium, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are the majority of your retrofitted operation platforms Originium-powered?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1723_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Your tone is starting to scare me, Mr. Friston. What are you trying to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a genius, Closure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1723_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4093_frston_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent thinking, cutting off the link between the retrofitted operation platforms and PRTS. But that's not enough, not by a long shot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friston-3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1723_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What's going on? Why are things shaking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
