        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_281_popka_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Morning\u2014hey, where did everybody go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Popukar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_281_popka_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's so quiet... where is Orchid? I can't reach her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Popukar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_281_popka_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should check the cafeteria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Popukar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cafeteria's... this way\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Popukar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Popukar's sleepy eyes are only half-open, but she could find her way from the deck to the cafeteria even if they were completely shut."
    },
    {
        "text": "That is how well she knows Rhodes Island\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_281_popka_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-Whoa, whoaaaa!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Popukar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
